  "cross_cutting_requirements": [
    "Track dataset license, attribution, source revision, checksum and permitted uses before acquisition or training.",
    "Keep train, validation and test sets separate; record contamination and deduplication checks.",
    "Never mark a capability TESTED based only on catalog presence, model-card claims, a successful download or an emulator.",
    "Run untrusted code and tools in least-privilege sandboxes with time, memory, disk and network limits.",
    "Do not require a paid API key; local adapters are optional and provider-specific.",
    "Record model/checkpoint hash, quantization, runtime version, hardware, seed, exact command and raw results.",
    "Distinguish model capability from tools, retrieval, deterministic software and human review.",
    "Agent workflows must not auto-merge, publish releases, access secrets or perform destructive actions without explicit policy and approval."
  ]
